Notice for internal/elk/elkjs

elk-worker.min.js is the file lib/elk-worker.min.js of the npm package elkjs
0.9.3 (https://github.com/kieler/elkjs), unchanged. elkjs is the Eclipse
Layout Kernel (ELK) 0.9.1, with the change of pull request 955, compiled
from Java to JavaScript with GWT.

elkjs is made available under the terms of the Eclipse Public License 2.0.
The file LICENSE.md in this directory has the license. The source code is at
