gives no notice for them, and the file does not state their versions. The
names of their Java packages are in the file.

  GWT, https://www.gwtproject.org
      Java packages: the Java runtime (java.lang, java.util) and
      com.google.gwt.core, com.google.gwt.i18n and com.google.gwt.json.
      License: Apache License 2.0.
      The source files of GWT have a notice of this form:
